[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01200000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01200000_01_0010","text":"咦，透……你不用休息吗？\n舞蹈那边没问题吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01200000_01_0020","text":"啊，嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01200000_01_0030","text":"……没问题就好\n节目，加油啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01200000_01_0040","text":"嗯——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01200000_01_0050","text":"透……不会紧张什么的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01200000_01_0060","text":"诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01200000_01_0070","text":"你也不是那种会紧张的类型吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01200000_01_0080","text":"啊——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01200000_01_0090","text":"哈哈\n真含糊啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01200000_01_0100","text":"呵呵\n不知道呢"}]
